      "content": "i hear you on the efficiency part, but the city council seems pretty set on it. they think the current system is too much of a black box. if we can't prove it's actually \"predictable\" enough for them, they're probably gonna pull the plug on the dynamic routing entirely. think there's any way to show them it's not a problem?",
